{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Run through levels performing parkour and altering elements of the environment to your will. Charge up your gauntlet to be able to run through levels at breakneck speeds, allowing you to show off your times in the process.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512970/extras/HackingComboTitle.gif?t=1744491052\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512970/extras/HackingCombo-Small.gif?t=1744491052\" />  <br>  <br>Create your own path, experiment with the level, and find the best possible route in order to ace every run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512970/extras/HighSpeedShowdowns_Title.gif?t=1744491052\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512970/extras/HighSpeedShowdown-Small.gif?t=1744491052\" /><br>Gain momentum in order to reach the end in the lowest time possible. The faster you are, the greater the reward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">    <br>   <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512970/extras/FindYourOwnpath_Title.gif?t=1744491052\" />   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong> </strong>   <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512970/extras/FindYourOwnpath-Small.gif?t=1744491052\" /><br>    <br>Each level has its own routes, but by exploring, experimenting, and making the most of your gauntlet, you\u2019ll be able to create your own shortcuts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">    <br>   <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512970/extras/RewardsForStyle_Title.gif?t=174449105